2. CONDITIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
(a) Notice. The copyright notice and this license shall be included in all
    copies or substantial portions of the Software.

(b) MySpec credit. Every copy, fork, remix, port or derivative work of the
    Software that is made public (hosted online, published, or distributed)
    must show a visible "Built with MySpec" credit that links to
    https://myspec.dev, in BOTH of these places:

      1. inside the running game or app (a dark or light credit, in any
         corner of the screen that stays visible, is fine), and
      2. at the top level of the project's README, in a short section that
         tells readers what MySpec is and links to https://myspec.dev.

    The credit may be restyled (colors, size, dark or light version, corner)
    but it must stay readable, must not be hidden, and must keep its link.

(c) Credit carries forward. If you let others fork or reuse your derivative
    work, you must keep this license (including this condition) on it, so the
    MySpec credit travels with every generation of the project.

(d) Contribution credits. Anyone who contributes to the Software (code, levels,
    art, sound, docs, translations) may add themselves to CREDITS.md in the
    same pull request, and is thereby credited next to MySpec. Contributions
    are accepted under these same license terms. Contributors who also share
    or write about their build with a link to https://myspec.dev earn a
    "Spread the word" mention in CREDITS.md.

(e) Private use. Copies that stay private (on your own machine, inside your
    school or company, never made public) do not need the in-app credit.

